  <h2>3 Things Brands Hide in Spec Sheets</h2>
  <p><b>1. CRI vs TLCI (Skin Tone Color Accuracy):</b> CRI 90+ har brand likhta hai, lekin TLCI metric sensor accuracy dikhata hai. Godox ka TLCI 97+ hai, jisse skin tones post-production me natural rehti hain.<br>
  <b>2. Bi-Color Power Penalty:</b> Bi-color lights me jab aap 3200K ya 6500K set karte hain, aadhe LEDs OFF rehte hain — 250W light real me ~130W output deti hai.<br>
  <b>3. Fan Noise vs Mic Distance:</b> High-wattage (250W-300W) lights me cooling fans loud ho sakte hain. Sensitve condenser mic ko light se 5-6 feet door rakhein.</p>

